Z||000014||Sage||10-31-2000||11:05 PM||||JMW;<P>You won't be sorry.  Doug has to be one of the most honest, straight forward, willing to help other enthusiests,Fiero people in the "business" today.<P>Not to take anything away from anyone else mentioned here, as I have also had good experiences with Rodney Dickman and have heard nothing but good things about everyone else.  I just have had more dealings with Doug than anyone else, and feel obligated to speak up on his behalf.<P>Not that he needs it!  You will see for yourself when you have anything to do with Doug, even if it's just making an inquiry!<P>If he doesn't have what you need or want, he will help you find it.  He works two, sometimes three jobs, but always seems to find time for Fellow Fiero owners in need.<P>Just my nichols worth!<P>Have a good one!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
